«Первая страница» — a film in the Marker on Paper style (Lemo-Opuscar library), on a squared notebook page.

IMAGES, FOOTAGE, MODELS
- None. The paper and its grid, every stroke, the figures, the laptop, the stairs, the peel and the subtitle slip are drawn
  in code (pen.js, film.js). No photographs, no scans, no AI-generated images.

FONTS (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
- Caveat — Impallari Type — https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/caveat (fonts/Caveat-OFL.txt)
  Bold and Regular instances made from the variable font with fontTools; glyph centre lines by tools/skeleton.py.

VOICE
- Russian narration: RHVoice (GPL/LGPL speech synthesizer, https://github.com/RHVoice/RHVoice), voice "Aleksandr" (aleksandr-hq),
  through tools/tts_ru.py. Synthetic voice, not a recording of a person.

MUSIC SAMPLES (CC0 1.0), through the library's core/audio/sampler.py
- contrabass pizzicato, clarinet, bassoon (sustained and staccato): VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios)
- shaker, claves, woodblock, glockenspiel, harp: Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios)

SOUND EFFECTS
- Felt-marker strokes, touch-downs, the peels and the push: synthesised in mix.py (filtered noise and envelopes).

CODE
- pen.js, the peel, the camera and mix.py are adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar library's styles/marker-paper/demo
  (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Lemomo (LemoLab); text in LICENSE-MIT.txt). Stroke geometry there adapted from its styles/whiteboard/demo/engine/wb.js.
